contentText:
Kenshi Yonezu &#8216;s &#8220;Karasu&#8221; debuts atop the Billboard Japan Hot 100 , on the chart released June 24.

The hitmaker wrote the song to be featured as the theme of NHK’s 2026 World Cup broadcasts. The track bows at No. 1 for downloads and streaming, and at No. 2 for radio airplay and video views. “Karasu” is Yonezu&#8217;s 11th chart-topper — his first since &#8220;IRIS OUT&#8221; — and marks his 32nd week at No. 1 on the Japan Hot 100.

